{"entity_id":"npc.isaac","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Isaac / 伊萨克","language":"zh","aliases":["Isaac","伊萨克","依萨克","罗宾"],"description_short":"伊萨克是第一作的可操作主角，偏金星元素，适合作为稳定前排和精神力使用者。","description_long":"低剧透理解即可：他是队伍行动核心，早期承担物理输出、探索精神力和队伍推进。中文资料中也可见“罗宾”等别名，使用时应映射到 Isaac。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"none","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.community_wiki","gs.zh_wiki_series","gs.localized_name_audit"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.gs.isaac.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["伊萨克是谁","罗宾是谁","伊萨克是什么定位"],"answer":"伊萨克是第一作主角，偏金星元素，早期可当稳定前排和探索精神力使用者。中文资料里有时也会把 Isaac 叫作罗宾。","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.localized_name_audit"],"spoiler_level":"none"}]}
{"entity_id":"npc.garet","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Garet / 加雷特","language":"zh","aliases":["Garet","加雷特"],"description_short":"加雷特是伊萨克的伙伴，偏火星元素，早期更像耐打的物理角色。","description_long":"他通常适合承担前排压力和稳定输出。新手不需要复杂混搭，先把火星精灵给他能保持简单明了的成长节奏。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"none","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.community_wiki","gs.localized_name_audit"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.gs.garet.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["加雷特是谁","加雷特适合怎么用"],"answer":"加雷特是早期伙伴，偏火星元素，比较适合前排承压和物理输出。新手先把火星精灵给他就很稳。","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"none"}]}
{"entity_id":"npc.ivan","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Ivan / 伊万","language":"zh","aliases":["Ivan","伊万","伊凡"],"description_short":"伊万是早期加入的木星元素角色，速度和精神力定位突出，但身体较脆。","description_long":"把他放在安全位置，让他用精神力和辅助能力参与战斗更稳。中文 ASR 常把“伊万”听成“伊凡”，应归到同一角色。","progress_gate":"early_game","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.community_wiki","gs.localized_name_audit"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.gs.ivan.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["伊万是谁","伊凡是谁","伊万怎么用"],"answer":"伊万是早期加入的木星元素伙伴，速度和精神力表现突出，但比较脆。让他站安全位置，用精神力参与输出或辅助更稳。","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
{"entity_id":"npc.mia","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Mia / 米娅","language":"zh","aliases":["Mia","米娅","米亚"],"description_short":"米娅是水星元素角色，常被新手当作队伍治疗与水系精神力核心。","description_long":"她的价值在于稳定队伍续航。Boss 战前要特别确认她的治疗相关职业和精神力没有因为精灵混搭被换掉。","progress_gate":"early_game","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.community_wiki","gs.localized_name_audit"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.gs.mia.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["米娅是谁","米亚是谁","谁负责治疗"],"answer":"米娅是水星元素伙伴，通常承担治疗和水系精神力职责。Boss 战前确认她的治疗技能还在，队伍会稳很多。","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
{"entity_id":"npc.jenna","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Jenna / 杰娜","language":"zh","aliases":["Jenna","杰娜"],"description_short":"杰娜是开局重要角色，和伊萨克、加雷特、菲利克斯等人的早期剧情有关。","description_long":"Lite 包只做低剧透身份说明，不展开后续剧情。问到她时，应避免直接泄露后期队伍与续作相关细节。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.community_wiki","gs.localized_name_audit"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.gs.jenna.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["杰娜是谁","Jenna 是谁"],"answer":"杰娜是开局重要角色，和伊萨克、加雷特、菲利克斯等人的早期剧情有关。这里先按低剧透身份理解即可。","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
